        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: British Airways, BA CityFlyer, Sun Air, Comair\n- Places: OR Tambo International Airport, Johannesburg, Cape Town International Airport, King Shaka International Airport\n- Topics: British Airways franchise operations, airline branding and service\n\nFacts:\n- British Airways, its wholly owned subsidiary BA CityFlyer, and franchise carriers Sun Air and Comair operate aircraft in full British Airways livery.\n- British Airways, BA CityFlyer, Sun Air, and Comair offer full British Airways service, and their staff wear British Airways uniforms.\n- Comair's main base is OR Tambo International Airport in Johannesburg.\n- Comair has focus cities at Cape Town International Airport and King Shaka International Airport.",
